  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7be775904db28fe4a999c7896671bd83, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoreStressedBoss3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterText: The first lady storms off, allowing the second to close the gap.
    She has a monster of a child, tearing down the candy next to them and screaming
    about how they wanted some doll in the toy aisle. Eventually, she erupts, screaming
    at the child. All you can focus on are the tears in your eyes and the pounding
    in your chest.
  encounterSprite: {fileID: 6949851453072517725, guid: 9c25ece9496312e4b9b82027a0693e90, type: 3}
  nextQuestion: {fileID: 0}
  responses:
  - You start to chuckle. The mom looks at you, confused... then pissed. She stops
    yelling at her kid and starts yelling at you. But you don't cry. You don't yell...
    all you do is smile. So much that you don't realize the line has moved on without
    you.
  - You fall to the floor and start crying. Whatever she says is no longer audible
    from the horrid tears. But at least when you look up, she's gone.
  - You start yelling at the mom. How horrible she's treating her child- how horrible
    her child is. Every issue you had today is unloaded onto the woman. The argument
    between you two gets worse... and worse... and then the security arrives. It
    doesn't matter who started it anymore. You are both thrown out of the line.
  - Thankfully, you hear the cashier ask you for your card. You rush to pay for your
    food and bolt out the doors before you can hear her scream again.
  punishment: 03000000ffffffff02000000ffffffff
  scaryMode: 1
  isABoss: 1
